SUMMARY:Cocalico Creek Watershed Association - December Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The Cocalico Creek Watershed Association will be hosting their December meeting on Monday\, December 14th at 7:00pm. For more details about the event\, refer to CCWA’s Facebook page. You can also contact Dave Weidman (super45mom@yahoo.com) with questions about the meeting.
URL:https://lancasterwatersheds.org/event/cocalico-creek-watershed-association-december-meeting-2/
